'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[Armor#Light-0|light armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
Both the [[Armor#Armor-0|armor]] and [[Armor#Helmet-0|helmet]] can be claimed on the [[Scope of Authority Premium Warbond|Scope of Authority]] page of the [[Superstore]] for {{Currency|SC|250|notext}} and {{Currency|SC|125}}, respectively.

